<title>USA: U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA rice export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 16,200 MT were 37 percent below the prior week and 71 percent under 4-week average.  The major buyers were Mexico (3,000 MT, of which 1,300 MT was rough), Germany (2,400 MT), Saudi Arabia (2,000 MT), Canada (1,600 MT), the Netherlands (1,300 MT), and Haiti (1,300 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 53,700 MT were down 36 percent from the previous week and 18 percent below the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Japan (21,800 MT), the Netherlands (14,100 MT), South Africa (5,200 MT), and Mexico (2,600 MT).</p>
</text>
